<title>NEW ZEALAND: Cricket-New Zealand set England 223 to win.</title>
<headline>Cricket-New Zealand set England 223 to win.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH, New Zealand 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand, batting first, scored 222 for six from their 50 overs on Thursday in the first one-day cricket international against England.</p>
<p>Score:</p>
<p>New Zealand 222 for six (N. Astle 50, C. Harris 48 not out, P. Tufnell 4-22)</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
